				 <i><span class="en">
					Meges
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.24.1
			</span></i> : pf.
			
				Pass.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέγλυμμαι</span>”
